    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“You were built for caves, collapse, and consequences.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Deep-Blooded.</strong> You reroll the lowest die on checks against poison and environmental Stress. You can’t be surprised by structural failure (collapsing ceilings, buckling catwalks) unless you are unconscious.</p>\n        <p><strong>Worksite Authority.</strong> You gain a skill rank with the Plating aptitude or the Plating aptitude. If you already have both, you gain expertise with one.</p>",
